  <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p><em>Operator: The White Mountain Education Association, Inc.. Last updated: 2026.</em></p>

  <h2>What We Collect</h2>
  <p>We collect only the information you voluntarily provide through our contact form (name, email address, and message). We do not use tracking cookies, run advertising, or sell personal data.</p>

  <h2>How We Use It</h2>
  <p>Contact form submissions are used solely to respond to your inquiry. We do not add you to mailing lists without your explicit consent.</p>

  <h2>Cookies</h2>
  <p>This site does not set cookies or use local storage. No personal information is stored in your browser.</p>

  <h2>Third-Party Services</h2>
  <p>This site is hosted on Netlify. Contact form submissions are processed and stored by Netlify Forms — Netlify retains submission data (name, email address, and message) in their dashboard. Please review <a href="https://www.netlify.com/privacy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Netlify's privacy policy</a> for details on data retention and handling. You may request deletion of your submission data by contacting us at the address below.</p>

  <h2>Your Rights</h2>
  <p>You may request deletion of any personal data you have submitted. Contact us at the address below.</p>

